      "content": "one thing to be careful about though—you know the data processing patent is actually facing that pretty serious legal challenge right now. it's not really just a minor procedural thing, it could actually be invalidated. \n\nif I tell them it's just \"negligible\" and they find out later that we knew it was at risk of being wiped out, won't that blow up the whole deal? how do we play this so we still get the $1.2B without it looking like we lied?",
